Hi Ross,

I'm not sure how to do this using SoX (someone on their mailing list might be able to help with that).

The best way I can think of to do it in seewave would be to compute a smoothed amplitude envelope using env(), and partition the sound based on thresholding this. This is more or less what the "Amplitude Detector" in Raven Pro does.

best,
jesse

